    "text": "By Garrett Dollin ,\n14 hours ago After falling short of expectations last season, the Slippery Rock University football team will get a preview of next year’s squad in their annual Green-White game Friday night. Although plenty of new faces will jog out of the tunnel at Mihalik-Thompson Stadium, there will be just as many familiar... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
